# Git LFS — large 3D model binaries only.
# Videos (*.mp4) and the HDRI (*.exr) stay as plain git: they're all under
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit and push fine without consuming LFS quota.
# Textured GLB hero buildings can be large (KitBash exports), so they go to LFS.
*.glb filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
